<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Chennai to Vellore | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a same‑day bike transport from Chennai to Vellore actually take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our dedicated fleet travels the 850 km NH 16 corridor with live GPS monitoring, typically completing the journey within 10‑12 hours. The same‑day service guarantees pickup in the morning and doorstep delivery by evening, provided there are no unforeseen road closures or extreme weather conditions.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my bike fully insured during the Chennai‑Vellore shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every bike is covered by 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. The policy protects against theft, accidental damage, and natural events, and a claim can be processed within 48 hours using the insurance certificate provided at delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes the 7‑layer packaging different from standard bike wrapping?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer system combines high‑density foam edge protectors, 80‑GSM bubble wrap, corrugated fiberboard, weather‑proof stretch film, custom wooden crates, and secure ratchet lashings. This multi‑shield approach absorbs shocks, prevents moisture ingress, and eliminates surface scratches, far exceeding typical single‑layer wraps.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike’s location in real time while it moves from Chennai to Vellore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each enclosed trailer is equipped with satellite GPS that streams live location updates to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking link via SMS and email, allowing you to monitor the bike’s progress at any moment during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you provide doorstep pickup and delivery for both residential and corporate moves?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our door‑to‑door service covers homes, apartments, corporate offices, and industrial premises. Our trained crew handles loading with hydraulic ramps, secures the bike on the carrier, and completes a hand‑over at the exact drop‑off address in Vellore, ensuring a seamless experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for bike transport between Chennai and Vellore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued ID, and a signed transport agreement. We also generate an e‑Way bill for GST compliance, and if the move is for a corporate or government entity, we provide a detailed invoice accepted for reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the cost of bike parcel service from Chennai to Vellore compare with other movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our pricing is transparent and based on distance, bike dimensions, packaging level, and insurance. Because we own a fleet of 120+ specialized trucks and follow ISO‑9001:2015 standards, we eliminate hidden fees and often offer a more competitive rate than generic packers and movers, especially for same‑day requests.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
